{"id":"n88331-2-7","stage":4,"title":"호황 · 景气","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88331-2-7-1","ko":"장사가 요즘처럼만 잘되면 정말 좋겠습니다.","zh":"要是生意能像现在这样好，那就太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장사가","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장사가","audio":"/audio/4931b0ea22819db2a3b1.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘처럼만","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘처럼만","audio":"/audio/566d94eaa68a5a2296bc.mp3"}},{"text":"잘되면","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘되면","audio":"/audio/cd343227420333d13f41.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠습니다.","meaning":"那样就好了","explanation":"좋다：那样就好了；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"18","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠습니다","audio":"/audio/7f7812f3e3b8e52db75b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b5b81ac6a045174c","term":"장사","zh":"生意，经商","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3","entryId":"71699","definition":"为获取利益而买卖东西；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["장사"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"那样就好了","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"否定前面的同时进行指责。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/d7df39533acb8fa0ee7c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88331-2-7-2","ko":"경기가 호황이라 다들 장사가 잘되나 보네요.","zh":"看来因为经济形势不错，大家的生意都挺兴隆的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기가","meaning":"经济状况","explanation":"경기：经济状况；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25710","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기가","audio":"/audio/1735f3414b564c4d1166.mp3"}},{"text":"호황이라","meaning":"景气，繁荣","explanation":"호황：景气，繁荣；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"호황","audio":"/audio/a65d73bc32a6093cf801.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88331","senseId":"2","lemma":"호황","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"호황이라","audio":"/audio/63246cd7f159eb01dabd.mp3"}},{"text":"다들","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다들","audio":"/audio/95e0c9a40303ff931c0d.mp3"}},{"text":"장사가","meaning":"生意，经商","explanation":"장사：生意，经商；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"장사","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71699","senseId":"1","lemma":"장사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장사가","audio":"/audio/4931b0ea22819db2a3b1.mp3"}},{"text":"잘되나","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘되나","audio":"/audio/26c01fd5c30620b176a1.mp3"}},{"text":"보네요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보네요","audio":"/audio/a6513b811204efa2ffc8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"经济状况","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"25710","definition":"买卖或交易中表现出的景气与不景气等，与经济领域有关的状况。","pronunciation":["경기"]},{"id":"a65d73bc32a6093c","term":"호황","zh":"景气，繁荣","audio":"/audio/a65d73bc32a6093cf801.mp3","entryId":"88331","definition":"经济活动比一般水平活跃的状态。","pronunciation":["호ː황"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"b5b81ac6a045174c","term":"장사","zh":"生意，经商","audio":"/audio/b5b81ac6a045174cac69.mp3","entryId":"71699","definition":"为获取利益而买卖东西；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["장사"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/761a94879a75c893c129.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWor